            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h3>Our Approach</h3><p><em>Our approach integrates trauma-informed therapy, psychological evaluation, and professional training within one cohesive practice. We draw from EMDR, somatic psychology, Internal Family Systems, Dialectical Behavior Therapy, Acceptance and Commitment Therapy, Ecotherapy, and mindfulness-based frameworks, always tailoring care to the individual. </em></p><p><em>Our clinicians and counselors work with adults, teens, children, and families navigating anxiety, depression, complex trauma, PTSD, grief, identity concerns, and life transitions throughout Delaware.</em></p>",
            "link_text": "Our Services",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/services",
            "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#2b5275",
            "text_gradient": "",
