          "settings": {
            "text": "Meet Our Team",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_z83XBy": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<p>The team at Center for Balanced Living includes psychologists, counselors, and support staff committed to trauma-informed, relationally grounded, and evidence-based care. </p><p>Our practice brings together a range of clinical specialties and professional backgrounds to support children, adolescents, adults, families, and clinicians with thoughtful, high-quality services. </p>"
          }
        },
        "image_rQeKWf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/group.png",
            "width_mode": "full_width",
            "max_width": 1000,
            "mobile_max_width": 400
          }
        },
        "richtext_iqrYhg": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "paragraph_class_name": "richtext-p-section",
            "content": "<p>Across therapy, psychological evaluation, supervision, and consultation, our team is dedicated to care that is both clinically rigorous and deeply human.</p><p>Their collective expertise is aimed at providing holistic and comprehensive care, leveraging a variety of therapeutic practices to support each client's journey towards balanced living and wellness.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
